{"id":195,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と理数で挑む宮崎西附属中学校","feature_description":"宮崎西高等学校附属中学校は、中高一貫教育の中で知性・人間性・創造性を育む特色ある学びを進める学校です。公式サイトでは、6年間を見通した探究型の学習と、都市部の教育資源を生かした一流に触れる機会が整理されており、理数教育の強さも確認できます。 中学の部活動は学校生活の一部として案内され、授業・行事・探究を支える活動が見て取れます。","clubs":[{"id":3618,"name":"中学陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3619,"name":"中学サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3620,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3621,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3622,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3623,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3624,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3625,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3626,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://cms.miyazaki-c.ed.jp/6037/%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3627,"name":"書道部","c